WEBVTT

00:14:29.907 --> 00:14:33.201
vaccines are a miracle
and there's a lot more we can do.

00:14:33.660 --> 00:14:36.079
HW: So the future is
in our hands in the present.

00:14:36.580 --> 00:14:38.707
Bill Gates, thank you
so much for being here.

00:14:38.707 --> 00:14:39.875
BG: Thank you.

00:14:39.917 --> 00:14:43.462
(Applause)